            <h4 class="debug-title">Debug Info <span class="wow-badge">DEBUG</span></h4>
            <div class="debug-status-row">
                <span>Build: <b>DEBUG</b></span>
                <span>Engine: <b>@(_running ? "🟢 Running" : "🔴 Paused")</b></span>
                <span>⏱ Game-Time: <b>@FormatElapsed(_gameElapsedSeconds)</b></span>
                <span>⚡ Speed: <b>@_speedMultiplier.ToString("0.#")×</b></span>
                <span>Last: @_engine.LastLog</span>
            </div>

            <div class="debug-speed-row">
                <span class="debug-speed-label">Speed:</span>
